    "body": "The head does not merge with `main`. PR #2670 merged at 03:47 UTC and both PRs change `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tool_settings.rs` and `tests/tool_holder_reference.rs`. This is a real overlap, not a false conflict.\n\nWhat to fix: merge `origin/main` into your branch (do not rebase), and keep both sides. In `tool_settings.rs`, main now calls `preview_inputs(state, exists)` and passes `(body, steel)` to `tool_preview::draw`. In the test file, main's #2016 and #2007 strings now read \"In use: ...\". Then push and ask for a re-check. No code review of this head was done.\n",
